med by grief like  Igor's family he was a husband a father  a brother shot dead by Russian soldiers  he was the best brother you could have I  was so proud of him and now something  this terrible has happened to us  deaths and destruction is all that is  left after the withdrawal of Russian  forces from germanyhif and what those  who survived fear most is that the  Russian army might return  Alexandra given the atrocities that were  committed in areas Under Siege by the  Russians is the Ukrainian government  still willing to negotiate with Moscow  on ending this war  yes they  and the Ukrainian president has made it  clear repeatedly how hard it is to think  about rasumik the talks to think about  sitting together with Russian  Representatives after what happened in  butcher borodianca other places however  he also said that it's important to talk  because what the country needs is of  course a ceasefire and everyone here  wants the war to end  Alexandra thank you very much for your  reporting our correspondent Alexander  phenomen there in Kiev
 

